#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/xfce/core/xfce4-settings.xml:30
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"The <application>Xfce4 Settings</application> package contains a collection "
"of programs that are useful for adjusting your "
"<application>Xfce</application> preferences."
msgstr ""
"O pacote <application>Xfce4 Settings</application> contém uma coleção de "
"aplicativos que são úteis para ajustar as tuas preferências do "
"<application>Xfce</application>."

